Note: UNSEEN non-animal monsters will generate the "You hear a <sound> nearby." 
      <sound> is either a "rushing noise" (for vortices, etc.) or a "splat!"
      for ochre jellies. In NetHack, most "You hear..." messages are generated 
      when the player is blind, or can't see the thing that she is hearing.

